# --- Archives (GitHub "Download ZIP", release "Source code" archives, `git archive`) -------
# The Godot Asset Store (store.godotengine.org, Godot 4.7+) does NOT download GitHub
# archives: each version is a zip uploaded by hand on the asset's Versions page, built
# with `node scripts/build-addon-zip.mjs` (dist-addon/godot_mcp-<version>.zip, only
# addons/godot_mcp/ inside). So no export-ignore rules are needed for the store, and we
# keep GitHub's source archives complete (server, docs, tests) for people building the
# server from source.
#
# Only if the addon is ALSO submitted to the legacy Asset Library
# (godotengine.org/asset-library, which installs a GitHub archive of a commit) should the
# rules below be enabled. They make every GitHub archive contain just addons/ (the pattern
# from docs.godotengine.org "Submitting to the Asset Store" > Recommendations):
#
# /**        export-ignore
# /addons    !export-ignore
# /addons/** !export-ignore
